# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  THIS IS A TEMPLATE. DO NOT PUT A REAL KEY IN THIS FILE.
#  This file IS committed. Anything you type here becomes public.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
#  To run with a real key on your own machine, make a NEW file next to this
#  one called exactly  .env  and put your values in that. It is gitignored.
#
#    GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_key_here
#    ENVIRONMENT=development
#
#  On the cloud these go in the host's Environment Variables settings,
#  never in a file.
#
#  Variables the service reads:
#    GROQ_API_KEY   the model key. Without it the service runs in demo mode.
#    ENVIRONMENT    development, staging or production. Default development.
#    DATABASE_URL   a Postgres URL. Without it the service uses a SQLite file,
#                   which does NOT survive on a cloud host.
#    SQLITE_PATH    where to put that file locally. Optional.
